NOTE ON HUMAN-SUBJECT DATA

These records are pseudonymised, not anonymised. Direct identifiers and the
strongest quasi-identifiers have been removed or coarsened, but with a sample
of this size re-identification cannot be excluded. Do not attempt to
re-identify participants, and do not combine this dataset with other sources
for that purpose. See ../docs/ETHICS.md for the approval under which it was
collected and the transformations applied.
